I'm now evaluating various positioning strategies for the login buttons. The current `absolute` positioning, relative to the viewport, places the buttons too far from the central login card on larger screens. I'm considering using a container to constrain the width or repositioning the buttons relative to the card itself to improve proximity. A centralized layout seems promising.


